  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So we have options to change the volume of our mic and mute it. What if we just duplicated that to regulate how loud is our avatar's sounds?\n\nPractic example: I have a bunch of dances as custom emotes that play music when played, but I don't always want that music to play. I might want to dance to someone else's music, and if I start dancing now my music will just drown the one already playing or mix together to make an ear-bleeding abomination. Or, I don't know, sometimes you just don't want to make noise, you know?\n\nWhat do you all think about this?",
